<title>USA: Schmitt Industries sees 1997 shr $0.26.</title>
<headline>Schmitt Industries sees 1997 shr $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schmitt Industries Inc said Wednesday that it estimates earnings for its fiscal year ended May 31, 1997 to be approximately $0.26 per share, compared with $0.16 per share the year before.</p>
<p>Schmitt said sales for the year were $11,061,942 versus $7,080,128.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the trends in increased sales and profitability to continue into fiscal 1998 and beyond.</p>
<p>It said that major new customers were added to its Balancer business and its Measurement business during the month of May.</p>
<p>Schmitt said that it also expects to release new Measurement products and Balancer products in fiscal 1998 which are now under development.</p>
</text>
